(3273677, 457552, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good concept for the  challenge theme.  Shot from a different angle would make this better, but I don''t see a way to get the dog''s expression  that way, unless you put a mirror on the door and shoot from behind the dog.</td>', 'Good concept for the  challenge theme.  Shot from a different angle would make this better, but I don''t see a way to get the dog''s expression  that way, unless you put a mirror on the door and shoot from behind the dog.', '2007-01-24 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3273684, 455911, 69008, '<td valign="top">Power colors!</td>', 'Power colors!', '2007-01-24 01:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3273686, 457752, 57378, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and great post processing - Only niggle is it looks a little too contrived - Maybe if the chair had gone it would look more natural. Nice shot though.</td>', 'Lovely shot and great post processing - Only niggle is it looks a little too contrived - Maybe if the chair had gone it would look more natural. Nice shot though.', '2007-01-24 01:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
