(3279150, 457256, 69008, '<td valign="top">I can''t really connect this image to "entrance".</td>', 'I can''t really connect this image to "entrance".', '2007-01-25 00:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279162, 457021, 69008, '<td valign="top">Simple, solid forms and line going up. No room for misinterpetation with this image. This is "The Entrance!"</td>', 'Simple, solid forms and line going up. No room for misinterpetation with this image. This is "The Entrance!"', '2007-01-25 00:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279176, 457693, 69008, '<td valign="top">Diffusion on the light would help reduce highlights on the chess pieces a bit. <br/>Only chess players would grasp the meaning of the title.  Detail is very sharp all over  the image.</td>', 'Diffusion on the light would help reduce highlights on the chess pieces a bit. Only chess players would grasp the meaning of the title.  Detail is very sharp all over  the image.', '2007-01-25 00:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279183, 455900, 69008, '<td valign="top">Technically very good, but not an image I would want to hang on my wall : )</td>', 'Technically very good, but not an image I would want to hang on my wall : )', '2007-01-25 00:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279186, 457733, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good concept with the locket. I feel that the image will be getting hammered for the shadow.  I would have done this idea over a candle lit dinner table, with his and her hands. I know that takes a lot of setting up though to photograph it well.</td>', 'Good concept with the locket. I feel that the image will be getting hammered for the shadow.  I would have done this idea over a candle lit dinner table, with his and her hands. I know that takes a lot of setting up though to photograph it well.', '2007-01-25 00:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279195, 456162, 69008, '<td valign="top">Correctly exposed slow shutter. Meets challenge criteria head on.  It seems to need something out of the ordinary to give it some extra punch. I''m not sure what that would be.</td>', 'Correctly exposed slow shutter. Meets challenge criteria head on.  It seems to need something out of the ordinary to give it some extra punch. I''m not sure what that would be.', '2007-01-25 00:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279196, 455015, 69008, '<td valign="top">I do not think this would be seen as a major "entrance" without the title. I understand what you were shooting for. Perhaps a couple of children running to the water would have been helpful.</td>', 'I do not think this would be seen as a major "entrance" without the title. I understand what you were shooting for. Perhaps a couple of children running to the water would have been helpful.', '2007-01-25 00:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279199, 457321, 31637, '<td valign="top">great contrast.</td>', 'great contrast.', '2007-01-25 00:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279205, 456027, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good color splash with the red on all the blue. I believe I would have tried to be there when the neon was just being lit up, before the sky faded down. Maybe they do not turn it on this time of year? <br/>Good concept, and the image is sharp everywhere in the frame. I like it that way so I can make my own decision about what I want to look at in an image, but most people like to be led to the primary subject by depth of field and other visual clues.</td>', 'Good color splash with the red on all the blue. I believe I would have tried to be there when the neon was just being lit up, before the sky faded down. Maybe they do not turn it on this time of year? Good concept, and the image is sharp everywhere in the frame. I like it that way so I can make my own decision about what I want to look at in an image, but most people like to be led to the primary subject by depth of field and other visual clues.', '2007-01-25 00:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279209, 457274, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very simple, and very "classic-ish."  The title fits the image thru direct connection with a detail, which I like.</td>', 'Very simple, and very "classic-ish."  The title fits the image thru direct connection with a detail, which I like.', '2007-01-25 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279210, 457786, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good catch.</td>', 'Good catch.', '2007-01-25 00:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279219, 456847, 69008, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Carney art is so very cheezy that it''s cool. All the wires are a problem.</td>', 'Great colors. Carney art is so very cheezy that it''s cool. All the wires are a problem.', '2007-01-25 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279220, 457786, 66201, '<td valign="top">creative and lovely.I think I would have tried to get the verticals lined up to parallel the frame of the picture (you can rotate the image...but not sure if allowed in Basic)...Then I would have cropped in tighter. I love the square format, and you could keep it square with a tighter crop. But still a more poetic interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'creative and lovely.I think I would have tried to get the verticals lined up to parallel the frame of the picture (you can rotate the image...but not sure if allowed in Basic)...Then I would have cropped in tighter. I love the square format, and you could keep it square with a tighter crop. But still a more poetic interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-01-25 00:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279226, 456228, 66201, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and composition. I think I would have liked a living being in this but that''s just personal.</td>', 'Nice crop and composition. I think I would have liked a living being in this but that''s just personal.', '2007-01-25 00:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279228, 457752, 66201, '<td valign="top">Nice processing. Just would have liked a living being going in through the door...</td>', 'Nice processing. Just would have liked a living being going in through the door...', '2007-01-25 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279234, 455808, 66201, '<td valign="top">A technically well-executed shot. Vivid colours and fun action. One thing I would have done is to line up the pattern background to parallel the frame...always difficult to get those horizons,verticals and horizontals to line up...not sure if you can rotate the image in Basic?  But this would make a great poster.</td>', 'A technically well-executed shot. Vivid colours and fun action. One thing I would have done is to line up the pattern background to parallel the frame...always difficult to get those horizons,verticals and horizontals to line up...not sure if you can rotate the image in Basic?  But this would make a great poster.', '2007-01-25 00:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3279236, 457497, 66201, '<td valign="top">I am intrigued by the image, but I''m not sure what it''s saying,doing,being?</td>', 'I am intrigued by the image, but I''m not sure what it''s saying,doing,being?', '2007-01-25 01:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
