(3279842, 455064, 37252, '<td valign="top">this is a really interesting and well executed shot. I cannot figure out why it is entered in the Entrance challenge though.....I have a strong feeling you meant this for the Minimalism challenge. I like it so well however, that I am only taking one point off what I would have given it had it met the theme it has been entered into. (9)</td>', 'this is a really interesting and well executed shot. I cannot figure out why it is entered in the Entrance challenge though.....I have a strong feeling you meant this for the Minimalism challenge. I like it so well however, that I am only taking one point off what I would have given it had it met the theme it has been entered into. (9)', '2007-01-25 03:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
