(3280566, 456817, 28172, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot! 9</td>', 'Really nice shot! 9', '2007-01-25 09:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280569, 455473, 28172, '<td valign="top">Nice timing!9</td>', 'Nice timing!9', '2007-01-25 09:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280580, 455320, 28172, '<td valign="top">Great timing!</td>', 'Great timing!', '2007-01-25 09:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280590, 457308, 28172, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Lovely shot!9</td>', 'Great concept!  Lovely shot!9', '2007-01-25 09:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280597, 455064, 61155, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge. whoops! nice shot though.</td>', 'wrong challenge. whoops! nice shot though.', '2007-01-25 09:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280598, 455618, 28172, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting!9</td>', 'Beautiful lighting!9', '2007-01-25 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280604, 456201, 48471, '<td valign="top">Why do you have to give such bad title to a photo? How can a window be an entrance, furthermore, an entrance to the soul? I am concentrated so much on the title, because that''s the major thing about this photo. This means that I can''t find anything interesting on this photo to hold my attention more than a glance.</td>', 'Why do you have to give such bad title to a photo? How can a window be an entrance, furthermore, an entrance to the soul? I am concentrated so much on the title, because that''s the major thing about this photo. This means that I can''t find anything interesting on this photo to hold my attention more than a glance.', '2007-01-25 09:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280626, 454384, 61155, '<td valign="top">Top pick. the tones and textures in this shot are just terrific. Very nicely composed too. Well done.</td>', 'Top pick. the tones and textures in this shot are just terrific. Very nicely composed too. Well done.', '2007-01-25 09:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280627, 455852, 48471, '<td valign="top">I think a shot like this begs for symmetry, and this shot obviously lacks it. I also think that the light isn''t good. I guess a shot early in the morning or late in the evening, when the light is diffused and with a warm cast, might improve the lightning, that is, the darkness of the gate and the whiteness of the pillars wouldn''t be so "angry" at each other.<br/> <br/>Seeing the reflection on the glass of the door, I think you could have made a good photo just by taking a shot of the gate, neglecting the pillars. What I''m trying to say is that there are so many elements here competing for attention: the gate, which is supposed to be the main subject of the photo, I guess, the pillars, the ceiling with the hanging lamp or whatever you call that thing. So, compositionally, I tend to think that this photo wasn''t thought out at all.</td>', 'I think a shot like this begs for symmetry, and this shot obviously lacks it. I also think that the light isn''t good. I guess a shot early in the morning or late in the evening, when the light is diffused and with a warm cast, might improve the lightning, that is, the darkness of the gate and the whiteness of the pillars wouldn''t be so "angry" at each other. Seeing the reflection on the glass of the door, I think you could have made a good photo just by taking a shot of the gate, neglecting the pillars. What I''m trying to say is that there are so many elements here competing for attention: the gate, which is supposed to be the main subject of the photo, I guess, the pillars, the ceiling with the hanging lamp or whatever you call that thing. So, compositionally, I tend to think that this photo wasn''t thought out at all.', '2007-01-25 09:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280630, 457503, 61155, '<td valign="top">One of the best for the challenge, imo. Sepia tones work great here and the dof is very effective. Very rustic. :o)</td>', 'One of the best for the challenge, imo. Sepia tones work great here and the dof is very effective. Very rustic. :o)', '2007-01-25 09:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280646, 456937, 72423, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the shadow seems too strong.  Better lighting would have made a better shot IMHO.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the shadow seems too strong.  Better lighting would have made a better shot IMHO.', '2007-01-25 09:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280655, 455151, 72423, '<td valign="top">This is neat.  I''d love to know where and what caused the lighting in the background and whether that mist is mist, fog or smoke.</td>', 'This is neat.  I''d love to know where and what caused the lighting in the background and whether that mist is mist, fog or smoke.', '2007-01-25 09:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280656, 455009, 48471, '<td valign="top">When I look at the photo, I see a handle, a metallic one, of the kind that you''re supposed to press with the thumb and then push. This handle is put on a wooden door, without any fancy texture, design, or patterns. That is, one of the most common and boring doors out there. I don''t know where this door leads, but I''d guess is one of those doors to some quite normal and usual, bordering with boring, rooms. It looks like a door of a family house.<br/> <br/>Now, I pray tell me, how am I to relate this ordinary door with the excitement that the title asks? Is the composition such that evokes a dramatic moment? I don''t think so, I even think that you didn''t even bent your knees enough to push the handle on my face. Is the lightning such that the shadows cast evoke a sense of danger? No, I don''t find them. <br/> <br/>A photo is supposed to equal a thousand words. Your title made a thousand pictures on my mind, and none of them is the one you''ve taken.<br/> <br/>So, to finally answer your question: yes, please enter, there''s nothing spectacular on the other side.</td>', 'When I look at the photo, I see a handle, a metallic one, of the kind that you''re supposed to press with the thumb and then push. This handle is put on a wooden door, without any fancy texture, design, or patterns. That is, one of the most common and boring doors out there. I don''t know where this door leads, but I''d guess is one of those doors to some quite normal and usual, bordering with boring, rooms. It looks like a door of a family house. Now, I pray tell me, how am I to relate this ordinary door with the excitement that the title asks? Is the composition such that evokes a dramatic moment? I don''t think so, I even think that you didn''t even bent your knees enough to push the handle on my face. Is the lightning such that the shadows cast evoke a sense of danger? No, I don''t find them.  A photo is supposed to equal a thousand words. Your title made a thousand pictures on my mind, and none of them is the one you''ve taken. So, to finally answer your question: yes, please enter, there''s nothing spectacular on the other side.', '2007-01-25 09:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280660, 454629, 72423, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is.  The ripples on the water seem too out of focus to me and there is too much blackness in the foreground.</td>', 'Not sure what this is.  The ripples on the water seem too out of focus to me and there is too much blackness in the foreground.', '2007-01-25 09:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280662, 455079, 48471, '<td valign="top">I love the grain, the black and white, the shadows, the darkness...a beautiful photo.</td>', 'I love the grain, the black and white, the shadows, the darkness...a beautiful photo.', '2007-01-25 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280669, 457571, 72423, '<td valign="top">Shame Prince Charming got chopped and there seems to be too much of a red cast to the shot.</td>', 'Shame Prince Charming got chopped and there seems to be too much of a red cast to the shot.', '2007-01-25 10:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280680, 456171, 72423, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the keyhole looks too out of focus and there is not really much to see on the other side.  There is too much black, which over dominates the shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the keyhole looks too out of focus and there is not really much to see on the other side.  There is too much black, which over dominates the shot.', '2007-01-25 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3280685, 457183, 48471, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what are the cigarette, the knife and the bottle supposed to mean. How do they help this photo?<br/> <br/>It seems that you had some great light there, covering just half of the book. I guess giving more thoughts to it might have put a more dramatic effect to the book, that is by darkening the shadows more. Also, the shadow of the body cast on the wall doesn''t help at all.<br/> <br/>Still, a good idea that needs returning to.</td>', 'I don''t understand what are the cigarette, the knife and the bottle supposed to mean. How do they help this photo? It seems that you had some great light there, covering just half of the book. I guess giving more thoughts to it might have put a more dramatic effect to the book, that is by darkening the shadows more. Also, the shadow of the body cast on the wall doesn''t help at all. Still, a good idea that needs returning to.', '2007-01-25 10:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280689, 457433, 72423, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but it''s not too clear whether this is an exit or an entrance.  The photo is not as sharp as it could be and looks a bit too brown.</td>', 'Nice idea, but it''s not too clear whether this is an exit or an entrance.  The photo is not as sharp as it could be and looks a bit too brown.', '2007-01-25 10:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280691, 456937, 48471, '<td valign="top">So simple, so beautiful. Just a remark on the light on the top half of the knob: I wish the color/lightning was the same everywhere.</td>', 'So simple, so beautiful. Just a remark on the light on the top half of the knob: I wish the color/lightning was the same everywhere.', '2007-01-25 10:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280694, 455473, 65069, '<td valign="top">the balls!</td>', 'the balls!', '2007-01-25 10:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280696, 456270, 72423, '<td valign="top">The train is too small and does not dominate the shot.  The detail of the trees has been lost too.  A little under exposed.  Shame about the fence in the foreground - it''s a distraction.</td>', 'The train is too small and does not dominate the shot.  The detail of the trees has been lost too.  A little under exposed.  Shame about the fence in the foreground - it''s a distraction.', '2007-01-25 10:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280701, 457184, 72423, '<td valign="top">Can''t see enough of the sunrise!</td>', 'Can''t see enough of the sunrise!', '2007-01-25 10:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280718, 457730, 72423, '<td valign="top">The texture of the skin is great below and just above the eye, but there is too much out of focus.  It would have been nice to have seen a little more of the eye too.  There is not enough ''hole'' to merit the title.</td>', 'The texture of the skin is great below and just above the eye, but there is too much out of focus.  It would have been nice to have seen a little more of the eye too.  There is not enough ''hole'' to merit the title.', '2007-01-25 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280719, 457739, 48471, '<td valign="top">How am I to see your intension of this photo, expressed by the title, without reading the title? I just see some scattered old keys, which can be interesting subject by itself, if photographed properly. And the postprocessing leaves to be desired.</td>', 'How am I to see your intension of this photo, expressed by the title, without reading the title? I just see some scattered old keys, which can be interesting subject by itself, if photographed properly. And the postprocessing leaves to be desired.', '2007-01-25 10:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280747, 455064, 72423, '<td valign="top">I like the ''feel'' of this image, but I''m not sure how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the ''feel'' of this image, but I''m not sure how it meets the challenge.', '2007-01-25 10:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280756, 454583, 48471, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great invitation, the photo says: come on, enter to my world of joy and fun. Great idea!<br/> <br/>Technically, there''s still a lot to be done. The choice of angle is a very good one, but I want to see a bit of his face, so that I don''t wander looking around and outside of the room and the hanging pictures.  A side shot maybe?</td>', 'This looks like a great invitation, the photo says: come on, enter to my world of joy and fun. Great idea! Technically, there''s still a lot to be done. The choice of angle is a very good one, but I want to see a bit of his face, so that I don''t wander looking around and outside of the room and the hanging pictures.  A side shot maybe?', '2007-01-25 10:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280781, 454616, 48471, '<td valign="top">A wonderful idea, but I don''t really like the light here. The left side, especially the top left side is to bright compared with the right side. I''d prefer a complete one-sided lightning, or a uniform one. This way, it looks like a half-baked realization of a well thought idea.</td>', 'A wonderful idea, but I don''t really like the light here. The left side, especially the top left side is to bright compared with the right side. I''d prefer a complete one-sided lightning, or a uniform one. This way, it looks like a half-baked realization of a well thought idea.', '2007-01-25 10:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280783, 457578, 72423, '<td valign="top">This shot is not balanced enough for me. Nice attempt, but the composition is missing something IMHO.</td>', 'This shot is not balanced enough for me. Nice attempt, but the composition is missing something IMHO.', '2007-01-25 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280792, 456656, 48471, '<td valign="top">A high contrast would do good for this photo. I think. And, black and white also - the blue of the sky is so bad here. Or, color saturation, a lot of it. Still, a nice capture of rays.</td>', 'A high contrast would do good for this photo. I think. And, black and white also - the blue of the sky is so bad here. Or, color saturation, a lot of it. Still, a nice capture of rays.', '2007-01-25 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280796, 457772, 72423, '<td valign="top">Without the shadow around the nose this would have been great.</td>', 'Without the shadow around the nose this would have been great.', '2007-01-25 10:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280812, 457392, 48471, '<td valign="top">It looks like the point of the photo is the sky. And the window could play a secondary role, just as a frame. But, this frame hurts. And I think it hurts because it looks like you didn''t want the house in the left in the frame. This way you got your frame tilted, which I don''t think is a good thing.<br/> <br/>Instead, moving a bit further and including a bigger part of the window and the house might improve the photo; but then, it wouldn''t be sky entrance, but window exit.<br/> <br/>I guess I''m trying to tell you that the beautiful colours of the sky and the beautiful clouds you wanted to show to me, didn''t reach me. The other things did. I guess.</td>', 'It looks like the point of the photo is the sky. And the window could play a secondary role, just as a frame. But, this frame hurts. And I think it hurts because it looks like you didn''t want the house in the left in the frame. This way you got your frame tilted, which I don''t think is a good thing. Instead, moving a bit further and including a bigger part of the window and the house might improve the photo; but then, it wouldn''t be sky entrance, but window exit. I guess I''m trying to tell you that the beautiful colours of the sky and the beautiful clouds you wanted to show to me, didn''t reach me. The other things did. I guess.', '2007-01-25 10:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280829, 455767, 48471, '<td valign="top">I wish there were people on this shot. This way, it''s just a cold photo of some pillars standing there. And, how am I supposed to know that this is the gateway to academia?</td>', 'I wish there were people on this shot. This way, it''s just a cold photo of some pillars standing there. And, how am I supposed to know that this is the gateway to academia?', '2007-01-25 10:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280830, 457738, 52713, '<td valign="top">road needs more detail. Hard to do with snow, I know.</td>', 'road needs more detail. Hard to do with snow, I know.', '2007-01-25 10:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280837, 457775, 52713, '<td valign="top">focus and glare issues</td>', 'focus and glare issues', '2007-01-25 10:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280844, 455064, 52713, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge?</td>', 'Wrong challenge?', '2007-01-25 10:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280855, 457787, 48471, '<td valign="top">I want to like this, I really do. But I can''t. I know it''s a good photo, a very clever one, a very smart. But...I don''t know. Maybe because it isn''t monochrome. Maybe because the hole isn''t shouting, so my eyes wonder out there looking at the horizon. <br/> <br/>And I have no idea how this great find could be improved.</td>', 'I want to like this, I really do. But I can''t. I know it''s a good photo, a very clever one, a very smart. But...I don''t know. Maybe because it isn''t monochrome. Maybe because the hole isn''t shouting, so my eyes wonder out there looking at the horizon.  And I have no idea how this great find could be improved.', '2007-01-25 10:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280865, 457713, 48471, '<td valign="top">I sense there was a desire to come up with a beautiful photo, a nice landscape covered in snow. But then the title is sounds like a journalistic caption. These two things hurt each other. And none of them helps make the photo meet the challenge. Not that I care much about meeting the challenge, but I feel that you do.<br/> <br/>And, yes, I think the house hidden there in the centre of the photo could add so much, but you decided not to include it, by hiding it behind the trees.</td>', 'I sense there was a desire to come up with a beautiful photo, a nice landscape covered in snow. But then the title is sounds like a journalistic caption. These two things hurt each other. And none of them helps make the photo meet the challenge. Not that I care much about meeting the challenge, but I feel that you do. And, yes, I think the house hidden there in the centre of the photo could add so much, but you decided not to include it, by hiding it behind the trees.', '2007-01-25 10:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3280897, 457142, 59029, '<td valign="top">I love spooky shots like this, very atmospheric - 8</td>', 'I love spooky shots like this, very atmospheric - 8', '2007-01-25 11:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
