(3281029, 457444, 70369, '<td valign="top">This place looks enchanting.. It''s beautiful.</td>', 'This place looks enchanting.. It''s beautiful.', '2007-01-25 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281034, 456083, 70369, '<td valign="top">Go BUCKEYE''S !!!! lol.. Sorry, as a true Ohio St. fan, I have to score you a one for the subject matter alone.. (Just kidding), I think this is a solid 6. Great Job.</td>', 'Go BUCKEYE''S !!!! lol.. Sorry, as a true Ohio St. fan, I have to score you a one for the subject matter alone.. (Just kidding), I think this is a solid 6. Great Job.', '2007-01-25 11:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281043, 455392, 72839, '<td valign="top">I like the way you zoomed in on the child''s face, by doing this it creates a sense of intrigue and beauty.</td>', 'I like the way you zoomed in on the child''s face, by doing this it creates a sense of intrigue and beauty.', '2007-01-25 11:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281050, 457502, 72838, '<td valign="top">I like the bright yellow. It really makes the picture stand out.</td>', 'I like the bright yellow. It really makes the picture stand out.', '2007-01-25 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281064, 457575, 72841, '<td valign="top">A beautifully composed image! Great use of lighting, it gives the scenery on the other side of the door a dreamy effect. And the title makes the scene even more emotional for the viewers. Great job!</td>', 'A beautifully composed image! Great use of lighting, it gives the scenery on the other side of the door a dreamy effect. And the title makes the scene even more emotional for the viewers. Great job!', '2007-01-25 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281084, 457069, 72841, '<td valign="top">It''s a little plain, but the excellent lighting makes up for it! It gives the door a great range of values, and adds a ton of interest to the photograph.</td>', 'It''s a little plain, but the excellent lighting makes up for it! It gives the door a great range of values, and adds a ton of interest to the photograph.', '2007-01-25 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281095, 456925, 48471, '<td valign="top">The kid is looking in the wrong place. I like how the light is controlled here. But, still, the photo doesn''t really talk to me.</td>', 'The kid is looking in the wrong place. I like how the light is controlled here. But, still, the photo doesn''t really talk to me.', '2007-01-25 11:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281110, 455911, 72840, '<td valign="top">I like the way the color is like a bright neon.  It really captures the eye!</td>', 'I like the way the color is like a bright neon.  It really captures the eye!', '2007-01-25 11:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281124, 455808, 72841, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very bright! The textured background creates a very interesting pattern in the glasses, and makes the lemons pop out from the glasses. The splashes of water also add a very nice dramatic element to the image. Great photo!</td>', 'Wow! Very bright! The textured background creates a very interesting pattern in the glasses, and makes the lemons pop out from the glasses. The splashes of water also add a very nice dramatic element to the image. Great photo!', '2007-01-25 11:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281130, 457786, 72840, '<td valign="top">The strongest part of this image is the color, the way that the butterfly and the door connect.  This meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'The strongest part of this image is the color, the way that the butterfly and the door connect.  This meets the challenge very well.', '2007-01-25 11:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281134, 457142, 72839, '<td valign="top">The best part of the image is the fact that there are many different types of the same color used (orange).Also, all the shades of orange are somewhat dark. This creates a dark and mysterious mood.</td>', 'The best part of the image is the fact that there are many different types of the same color used (orange).Also, all the shades of orange are somewhat dark. This creates a dark and mysterious mood.', '2007-01-25 11:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281141, 456760, 48471, '<td valign="top">Maybe cleaning a bit the branches would have helped on having only water and ice as your subjects. Then, maybe having a long shutter speed would make the water flow look better, smooth, almost icy, but different. And then getting rid of at least 75% of the title, so that I pay more attention to the photo than spending time reading. And definitely not including so much physics in a shot that tries to be artistic (I guess)...And, in the end, turning everything black and white. Then, I''d appreciate it better. As it is, I spend too much time thinking how it could be better, than just enjoying it as it is.</td>', 'Maybe cleaning a bit the branches would have helped on having only water and ice as your subjects. Then, maybe having a long shutter speed would make the water flow look better, smooth, almost icy, but different. And then getting rid of at least 75% of the title, so that I pay more attention to the photo than spending time reading. And definitely not including so much physics in a shot that tries to be artistic (I guess)...And, in the end, turning everything black and white. Then, I''d appreciate it better. As it is, I spend too much time thinking how it could be better, than just enjoying it as it is.', '2007-01-25 11:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281162, 457461, 72835, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo, i think that it was very smart to take this pic in black and white. There is a lot of line definity espically going up the walls also in the chairs too.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo, i think that it was very smart to take this pic in black and white. There is a lot of line definity espically going up the walls also in the chairs too.', '2007-01-25 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281174, 456374, 72835, '<td valign="top">This is another good photo showing a lot of good texture. Espically in the rocks. You can also see the quality of the compistion with the cracks in the rock walls</td>', 'This is another good photo showing a lot of good texture. Espically in the rocks. You can also see the quality of the compistion with the cracks in the rock walls', '2007-01-25 12:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281176, 456226, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture, tone, and contrast here.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice texture, tone, and contrast here.  Well done.', '2007-01-25 12:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281185, 455989, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty darn cold!  Love the way the wind bends the ice.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Looks pretty darn cold!  Love the way the wind bends the ice.  Nice shot.', '2007-01-25 12:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281188, 457535, 48471, '<td valign="top">A lot of bears and a written joke, with b instead of v. That''s what I see in this photo, nothing else. Light? Yes, it looks like it comes from the window on the left, with the ceiling lamp on. Did you try to do something with it, in the sense of creating a more dramatic or pleasing or inviting effect? Not that I can tell. And, how are bears supposed to be interesting, are they placed in such a way that tell me a story? Not that I can read one. Just scattered all over the place, filling the house, some of them in the window and some in the roof, some even upside down, and a frog to add to the variety. But, do I care about them? Would a kid care about them? I don''t think so. Maybe because they are to small in the overall photo to hold a kid''s attention. Maybe because their colours melt in the overall picture (the reds of the bricks are more emphasized than the bears), and the hanging strings are more vibrant than the bears. So many things, equaling to nothing, I''m afraid. Maybe, just like my comment.</td>', 'A lot of bears and a written joke, with b instead of v. That''s what I see in this photo, nothing else. Light? Yes, it looks like it comes from the window on the left, with the ceiling lamp on. Did you try to do something with it, in the sense of creating a more dramatic or pleasing or inviting effect? Not that I can tell. And, how are bears supposed to be interesting, are they placed in such a way that tell me a story? Not that I can read one. Just scattered all over the place, filling the house, some of them in the window and some in the roof, some even upside down, and a frog to add to the variety. But, do I care about them? Would a kid care about them? I don''t think so. Maybe because they are to small in the overall photo to hold a kid''s attention. Maybe because their colours melt in the overall picture (the reds of the bricks are more emphasized than the bears), and the hanging strings are more vibrant than the bears. So many things, equaling to nothing, I''m afraid. Maybe, just like my comment.', '2007-01-25 12:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281192, 457054, 72835, '<td valign="top">great useage of the kids</td>', 'great useage of the kids', '2007-01-25 12:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281198, 455731, 72835, '<td valign="top">nice placement of this photo i think this is a good overall photo and has a lot of strong suits</td>', 'nice placement of this photo i think this is a good overall photo and has a lot of strong suits', '2007-01-25 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3281204, 457713, 72835, '<td valign="top">a good example of a quiet atmosphere, nothing around just snow an trees</td>', 'a good example of a quiet atmosphere, nothing around just snow an trees', '2007-01-25 12:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
