(3283032, 455079, 30049, '<td valign="top">Unique.  Grabs the viewers attention - well at least it did for me.  :D  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Unique.  Grabs the viewers attention - well at least it did for me.  :D  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-25 21:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283040, 457141, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve incorporated more than just the door in this photo.  The flag flapping in the breeze adds a nice touch of movement and reality.  Cool and creepy.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like how you''ve incorporated more than just the door in this photo.  The flag flapping in the breeze adds a nice touch of movement and reality.  Cool and creepy.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-25 21:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283042, 455193, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m trying real hard, but I''m not connecting with this.  Sorry.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m trying real hard, but I''m not connecting with this.  Sorry.  Good luck.', '2007-01-25 21:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283047, 457503, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love this kind of work.  The color tone, the shallow DOF, the lighting, it all works.  Very well done!</td>', 'I love this kind of work.  The color tone, the shallow DOF, the lighting, it all works.  Very well done!', '2007-01-25 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283051, 457184, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something about this doesn''t feel quite right.  Is it tonemapped or something?  The sky looks surreal.  Hmmm.  Guess I''ll have to come back and see after the challenge is over.  Good luck.</td>', 'Something about this doesn''t feel quite right.  Is it tonemapped or something?  The sky looks surreal.  Hmmm.  Guess I''ll have to come back and see after the challenge is over.  Good luck.', '2007-01-25 21:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283175, 457386, 30049, '<td valign="top">Bet you had fun putting this one together.  :D  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Bet you had fun putting this one together.  :D  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-25 21:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283178, 457260, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, cute...put a smile on my face.  :D  Hope this does well for you.  Good luck!</td>', 'Simple, cute...put a smile on my face.  :D  Hope this does well for you.  Good luck!', '2007-01-25 21:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283183, 457738, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful B/W photo.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Wonderful B/W photo.  Nicely done!', '2007-01-25 21:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283190, 457651, 30049, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Now that''s one tight focus there!!!  Thanks for putting this together, I love it.  Great colors also.  After the challenge you''ll have to get rid of that one little black speck in there and sell a few prints of this.  Well done.</td>', 'WOW!  Now that''s one tight focus there!!!  Thanks for putting this together, I love it.  Great colors also.  After the challenge you''ll have to get rid of that one little black speck in there and sell a few prints of this.  Well done.', '2007-01-25 21:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283192, 457730, 30049, '<td valign="top">Jack!  Is that you!?  :D  Kind of creepy, but kind of cool also.  Good luck.</td>', 'Jack!  Is that you!?  :D  Kind of creepy, but kind of cool also.  Good luck.', '2007-01-25 21:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283196, 456374, 71951, '<td valign="top">Absolutely incredible photo.</td>', 'Absolutely incredible photo.', '2007-01-25 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283204, 455989, 71951, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!! Great contrasting colors. Very nice</td>', 'Awesome!!!! Great contrasting colors. Very nice', '2007-01-25 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283940, 455508, 69008, '<td valign="top">Slightly overexposed for my taste, and more contrast would make it a stronger image. That is just my own opinion.  Good choice of subject for the theme.</td>', 'Slightly overexposed for my taste, and more contrast would make it a stronger image. That is just my own opinion.  Good choice of subject for the theme.', '2007-01-26 00:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283956, 457528, 69008, '<td valign="top">Excellent light, and good use of the  box prop.</td>', 'Excellent light, and good use of the  box prop.', '2007-01-26 00:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3283993, 457502, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very graphic image with bold colors. Barely meets the challenge theme IMO, so knocking off a point.</td>', 'Very graphic image with bold colors. Barely meets the challenge theme IMO, so knocking off a point.', '2007-01-26 00:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284073, 456226, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like the wood in this image, and the "oldness" of it. It seems odd that the curtain is still in the window in the door. The shadows help add some depth, as this is generally a 2D scene.</td>', 'I like the wood in this image, and the "oldness" of it. It seems odd that the curtain is still in the window in the door. The shadows help add some depth, as this is generally a 2D scene.', '2007-01-26 01:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284135, 457231, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely classy entrance way.  Shooting straight on with the diffused light makes it  a little flat in this image, but it has good detail in the shady areas because of the light being soft. <br/>I see that the original lock is broken.</td>', 'This is an extremely classy entrance way.  Shooting straight on with the diffused light makes it  a little flat in this image, but it has good detail in the shady areas because of the light being soft. I see that the original lock is broken.', '2007-01-26 01:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284154, 456978, 69008, '<td valign="top">Flare seems rather hot, but no way to get the foreground detail without the flare. Nice place to be for a sunrise.</td>', 'Flare seems rather hot, but no way to get the foreground detail without the flare. Nice place to be for a sunrise.', '2007-01-26 01:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284195, 457417, 69008, '<td valign="top">I think this will do well. Great graphic design idea on the steps.  Good timing with the people on the steps for this image. The red jackets draw attention to the people, and the size of the staircase.</td>', 'I think this will do well. Great graphic design idea on the steps.  Good timing with the people on the steps for this image. The red jackets draw attention to the people, and the size of the staircase.', '2007-01-26 01:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284239, 457293, 69008, '<td valign="top">Black and white.  Color distracts from the fine composition that you have here. I feel that it would be much stronger without the color. The arches and beams and other lines make this a very dynamic image.</td>', 'Black and white.  Color distracts from the fine composition that you have here. I feel that it would be much stronger without the color. The arches and beams and other lines make this a very dynamic image.', '2007-01-26 01:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284256, 456757, 69008, '<td valign="top">Artsy looking with the low key color.  Nice compostion with the steps and massive railings.</td>', 'Artsy looking with the low key color.  Nice compostion with the steps and massive railings.', '2007-01-26 01:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284270, 456937, 69008, '<td valign="top">Simplicity works.</td>', 'Simplicity works.', '2007-01-26 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284288, 457424, 69008, '<td valign="top">A wider view, would be much better to meet the challenge theme.</td>', 'A wider view, would be much better to meet the challenge theme.', '2007-01-26 01:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284298, 456760, 69008, '<td valign="top">Techy title. A bit of a stretch to fit the challenge theme.</td>', 'Techy title. A bit of a stretch to fit the challenge theme.', '2007-01-26 01:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284421, 457456, 69008, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks planned, but it helps to put the accent on the subject. I am surprised that this is the first entry that I have seen with this "entering a new life" theme.</td>', 'The lighting looks planned, but it helps to put the accent on the subject. I am surprised that this is the first entry that I have seen with this "entering a new life" theme.', '2007-01-26 01:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284457, 457683, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good, even with the centered composition. The reflection is a very strong part of this image. Meets the challenge theme well too.</td>', 'Good, even with the centered composition. The reflection is a very strong part of this image. Meets the challenge theme well too.', '2007-01-26 01:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284478, 456817, 69008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location, and the haze is nice too. Well done in exposure, DOF, composition, and color. Including the boat adds a lot as it shows scale and that people interact with this place.</td>', 'Beautiful location, and the haze is nice too. Well done in exposure, DOF, composition, and color. Including the boat adds a lot as it shows scale and that people interact with this place.', '2007-01-26 01:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284487, 455064, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good idea, wrong challenge for this particular image. It would have been very right for the "Min" challenge.  It works here too.</td>', 'Good idea, wrong challenge for this particular image. It would have been very right for the "Min" challenge.  It works here too.', '2007-01-26 01:58:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3284515, 457142, 69008, '<td valign="top">Color works with the snow in this image. Spooky looking place, and very nice iron gate.</td>', 'Color works with the snow in this image. Spooky looking place, and very nice iron gate.', '2007-01-26 02:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284549, 457758, 69008, '<td valign="top">I see that you were shooting for the door in this image.  To get a more pleasing light for this type shot, try shooting at dusk or dawn, and have someone flip the light on for just a blink during a long exposure. That will expose the other parts of the scene a little better, and not blow away the area over the door.</td>', 'I see that you were shooting for the door in this image.  To get a more pleasing light for this type shot, try shooting at dusk or dawn, and have someone flip the light on for just a blink during a long exposure. That will expose the other parts of the scene a little better, and not blow away the area over the door.', '2007-01-26 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284580, 457308, 69008, '<td valign="top">Fine concept, and an excellent image. It connects with the "human" part of me.</td>', 'Fine concept, and an excellent image. It connects with the "human" part of me.', '2007-01-26 02:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284606, 457453, 69008, '<td valign="top">Seems out of level. Good depth of field, and sharpness. It seems quite an "unfancy" portal to be surrounded by such classy columns.</td>', 'Seems out of level. Good depth of field, and sharpness. It seems quite an "unfancy" portal to be surrounded by such classy columns.', '2007-01-26 02:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284632, 457312, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good use of the fisheye lens. I assume that the color is by street or security lighting, as it looks like hi pressure sodium. I would not want to work or live here, but it makes a cool looking and very symetrical image.</td>', 'Good use of the fisheye lens. I assume that the color is by street or security lighting, as it looks like hi pressure sodium. I would not want to work or live here, but it makes a cool looking and very symetrical image.', '2007-01-26 02:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284644, 457364, 69008, '<td valign="top">Stretching to meet the challenge theme with the image. Nice B&amp;W macro. The way the drops magnify the texture of the leaf is interesting.</td>', 'Stretching to meet the challenge theme with the image. Nice B&W macro. The way the drops magnify the texture of the leaf is interesting.', '2007-01-26 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284665, 456803, 69008, '<td valign="top">Making a statement with the title?    Focus should have been on Atlantis, and the other building  to fit the title better.<br/> Development is eating up the natural islands and making living more expensive there. It''s not good, but there is no going back.</td>', 'Making a statement with the title?    Focus should have been on Atlantis, and the other building  to fit the title better. Development is eating up the natural islands and making living more expensive there. It''s not good, but there is no going back.', '2007-01-26 02:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284683, 456813, 69008, '<td valign="top">Not a very captivating image, but it fits the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'Not a very captivating image, but it fits the theme of the challenge.', '2007-01-26 02:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284694, 455473, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good snapshot. I hope the watch is water proof. Fits the challenge theme well.</td>', 'Good snapshot. I hope the watch is water proof. Fits the challenge theme well.', '2007-01-26 02:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284699, 457226, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very loud color combo.  Captivating image.</td>', 'Very loud color combo.  Captivating image.', '2007-01-26 02:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284704, 455390, 69008, '<td valign="top">I feel for the people who lived there.  Stirring image.</td>', 'I feel for the people who lived there.  Stirring image.', '2007-01-26 02:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284720, 455493, 69008, '<td valign="top">I feel that your viewpoint was too close to get the effect that you were after in this image.  Shallow DOF would help too.</td>', 'I feel that your viewpoint was too close to get the effect that you were after in this image.  Shallow DOF would help too.', '2007-01-26 02:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284731, 457720, 69008, '<td valign="top">Nice image except for the people beyond the girls.</td>', 'Nice image except for the people beyond the girls.', '2007-01-26 02:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284737, 456656, 69008, '<td valign="top">The image and title are a package deal. Great rays, good score.</td>', 'The image and title are a package deal. Great rays, good score.', '2007-01-26 02:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284914, 457651, 36283, '<td valign="top">Excellent title it says it all</td>', 'Excellent title it says it all', '2007-01-26 03:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284924, 456132, 36283, '<td valign="top">I like the colors nice shot</td>', 'I like the colors nice shot', '2007-01-26 03:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284935, 457552, 36283, '<td valign="top">I feel its not sharp and has been taken with a point-shoot flash.. Try playing with the flash and the exposure compensation</td>', 'I feel its not sharp and has been taken with a point-shoot flash.. Try playing with the flash and the exposure compensation', '2007-01-26 03:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3284949, 454384, 36283, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with excellent colors</td>', 'Nice shot with excellent colors', '2007-01-26 03:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
