(3285938, 457571, 67001, '<td valign="top">Prince charming is a chick?!?! The crop is weird. I would have liked to see more of "long legs" right arm. The focus is a bit off.</td>', 'Prince charming is a chick?!?! The crop is weird. I would have liked to see more of "long legs" right arm. The focus is a bit off.', '2007-01-26 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3285944, 457733, 67001, '<td valign="top">Distracting shadow. The focus is off.</td>', 'Distracting shadow. The focus is off.', '2007-01-26 09:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3285974, 454583, 67001, '<td valign="top">This is what I think is off in this photo:<br/>1) Big black spot in the upper right.<br/>2) Foot is cropped out.<br/>3) Flash is harsh<br/>4) More emphasis on the door would have helped your points... To me, an upside down kid does not have anything to do with "Entrance"<br/> <br/>I hope that you don''t take this the wrong way. I would love for people to leave comments on my pics... I never seem to get any. Good luck.</td>', 'This is what I think is off in this photo:1) Big black spot in the upper right.2) Foot is cropped out.3) Flash is harsh4) More emphasis on the door would have helped your points... To me, an upside down kid does not have anything to do with "Entrance" I hope that you don''t take this the wrong way. I would love for people to leave comments on my pics... I never seem to get any. Good luck.', '2007-01-26 09:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3285986, 457774, 67001, '<td valign="top">Was this taken with a camera phone??? The quality is REALLY bad.</td>', 'Was this taken with a camera phone??? The quality is REALLY bad.', '2007-01-26 09:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
