(3286292, 455674, 69008, '<td valign="top">Interesting an humorous painting. It took me a while to locate the "push to open" in this size image. I feel that without the brick and the border, this image would get requested for DQ because of it being a direct reproduction of artwork. <br/>A polarizer would have helped with the reflection haze on the door on the right.<br/> I would never have thought to paint the water yellow.</td>', 'Interesting an humorous painting. It took me a while to locate the "push to open" in this size image. I feel that without the brick and the border, this image would get requested for DQ because of it being a direct reproduction of artwork. A polarizer would have helped with the reflection haze on the door on the right. I would never have thought to paint the water yellow.', '2007-01-26 10:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
