(3286361, 457386, 69008, '<td valign="top">This culvert shot would be really cool if the water was smooth and reflective.  You would then have the concentric arches reflected in the water too. <br/>It is an entrance, but not a very inviting one. There is nothing here to show scale, unless that is a very tiny human at the far end, but I am familiar with steel work, so I assume the plates are about 4 ft X 10 ft each.  People with no knowlege of steel would not have any idea about how big this pipe is. If that is a person at the end, it is too small in the image to make it out at web size.</td>', 'This culvert shot would be really cool if the water was smooth and reflective.  You would then have the concentric arches reflected in the water too. It is an entrance, but not a very inviting one. There is nothing here to show scale, unless that is a very tiny human at the far end, but I am familiar with steel work, so I assume the plates are about 4 ft X 10 ft each.  People with no knowlege of steel would not have any idea about how big this pipe is. If that is a person at the end, it is too small in the image to make it out at web size.', '2007-01-26 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286375, 455009, 69008, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge theme ok. Not much to be excited about as far as subject.  Fairly even light, except the hilights on the metal.</td>', 'Meets challenge theme ok. Not much to be excited about as far as subject.  Fairly even light, except the hilights on the metal.', '2007-01-26 11:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286438, 457539, 69008, '<td valign="top">I would have titled this with something to do with the unusual dimentions of the door. Something with some humor about it would be good for instance, "basket ball players entrance." <br/>Otherwise, good use of black and white. The image is a little out of level looking.</td>', 'I would have titled this with something to do with the unusual dimentions of the door. Something with some humor about it would be good for instance, "basket ball players entrance." Otherwise, good use of black and white. The image is a little out of level looking.', '2007-01-26 11:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
