(3286495, 454616, 69008, '<td valign="top">Open eyes and more attention to the edges of the "hat" would have helped this image. Strange concept, the kind of thing a musician/artist would think up. Looks like a fun shot, but not seeming to be well thought out and executed in a photo studio way.</td>', 'Open eyes and more attention to the edges of the "hat" would have helped this image. Strange concept, the kind of thing a musician/artist would think up. Looks like a fun shot, but not seeming to be well thought out and executed in a photo studio way.', '2007-01-26 11:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286532, 455980, 69008, '<td valign="top">It looks cold there. The lamp post does not seem in the right place in the image to me somehow, as it seems to unbalance the archway  by being in front of the column. A shot from closer to the house may have looked a little nicer by putting the post to the left of the big tree, but there may have been a house or something there that you did not want in the image.  It is a nice entry way, and an inviting looking gateway.</td>', 'It looks cold there. The lamp post does not seem in the right place in the image to me somehow, as it seems to unbalance the archway  by being in front of the column. A shot from closer to the house may have looked a little nicer by putting the post to the left of the big tree, but there may have been a house or something there that you did not want in the image.  It is a nice entry way, and an inviting looking gateway.', '2007-01-26 11:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
