(3290035, 454655, 72167, '<td valign="top">its the theme but doesn''t shout "wow"</td>', 'its the theme but doesn''t shout "wow"', '2007-01-27 04:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290036, 454558, 72167, '<td valign="top">this one doesn''t do much for me.....</td>', 'this one doesn''t do much for me.....', '2007-01-27 04:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290116, 457775, 43073, '<td valign="top">This didn''t do much for me; there are light reflections on the ball (on part of the frog), there are focus problems (I''m not sure where the focus is), and I think I would have liked the composition better if it was either dead center or more off-centered. I also wasn''t sure what was being said by the picture (beyond the straight forward title), so it didn''t really speak to me as an image.</td>', 'This didn''t do much for me; there are light reflections on the ball (on part of the frog), there are focus problems (I''m not sure where the focus is), and I think I would have liked the composition better if it was either dead center or more off-centered. I also wasn''t sure what was being said by the picture (beyond the straight forward title), so it didn''t really speak to me as an image.', '2007-01-27 05:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290117, 456853, 43073, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know what to think of this, but from an image perspective it didn''t do much for me; shadows, coloring and focus vary from the right columns to the left, and while it looks like some kind of long exposure, I wasn''t sure what was being said or why it was done this way.</td>', 'I didn''t know what to think of this, but from an image perspective it didn''t do much for me; shadows, coloring and focus vary from the right columns to the left, and while it looks like some kind of long exposure, I wasn''t sure what was being said or why it was done this way.', '2007-01-27 05:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290120, 457552, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, and I like the low angle. But, I wanted more depth of focus as I looked at it; the dog is either out of focus or far too soft, but the door handle is also out of focus, so I wasn''t quite sure where I should be looking. White balance also seems a bit off to me, so the whites are a tad out of sync to my eyes (compare the door to the wall behind the dog).</td>', 'I like this concept, and I like the low angle. But, I wanted more depth of focus as I looked at it; the dog is either out of focus or far too soft, but the door handle is also out of focus, so I wasn''t quite sure where I should be looking. White balance also seems a bit off to me, so the whites are a tad out of sync to my eyes (compare the door to the wall behind the dog).', '2007-01-27 05:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290133, 456027, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image is very well done technically, with good blues in the sky and generally sharp lines (though the bat on the right may be a bit out of focus) throughout. I didn''t really care for the subject matter or the composition, though; the green structure behind (for lights? press boxes) is distracting, and what I see of the entrance doesn''t really interest me as an entrance (personal preference, of course!).</td>', 'This image is very well done technically, with good blues in the sky and generally sharp lines (though the bat on the right may be a bit out of focus) throughout. I didn''t really care for the subject matter or the composition, though; the green structure behind (for lights? press boxes) is distracting, and what I see of the entrance doesn''t really interest me as an entrance (personal preference, of course!).', '2007-01-27 06:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290138, 456615, 43073, '<td valign="top">While I "got" this image, it didn''t do much for me as an image. Technically it''s okay, and I like the shadows and plays of light, but overall composition doesn''t win me over, though I''m not sure what I would suggest that you do differently.</td>', 'While I "got" this image, it didn''t do much for me as an image. Technically it''s okay, and I like the shadows and plays of light, but overall composition doesn''t win me over, though I''m not sure what I would suggest that you do differently.', '2007-01-27 06:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290140, 457215, 43073, '<td valign="top">I liked the blues in this image, but found the lock a bit dark, and the murky things inside the room distracting. A more extreme angle (so that you don''t actually see into the room), with a bit more brightness, might have improved it for me.</td>', 'I liked the blues in this image, but found the lock a bit dark, and the murky things inside the room distracting. A more extreme angle (so that you don''t actually see into the room), with a bit more brightness, might have improved it for me.', '2007-01-27 06:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290148, 457523, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject matter here, but the over-exposure and lack of focus on the rough stones/bricks to the right of the door really distracted me, as did the dark spot at the upper right of the shot. A closer framing of the shot and darkening the whole by a couple of stops might have helped it for my eyes.</td>', 'I really like the subject matter here, but the over-exposure and lack of focus on the rough stones/bricks to the right of the door really distracted me, as did the dark spot at the upper right of the shot. A closer framing of the shot and darkening the whole by a couple of stops might have helped it for my eyes.', '2007-01-27 06:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290162, 454616, 43073, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure what to think of this (I''ll bet you''re getting that a lot on this image). Looking at it simply from a technical perspective it''s okay, though the white is not consistent throughout (it looks a bit yellowish in spots and a bit pinkish in others). Really, though, it just speak to me as an image.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure what to think of this (I''ll bet you''re getting that a lot on this image). Looking at it simply from a technical perspective it''s okay, though the white is not consistent throughout (it looks a bit yellowish in spots and a bit pinkish in others). Really, though, it just speak to me as an image.', '2007-01-27 06:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290171, 455503, 43073, '<td valign="top">I felt like I should have liked this image better; it''s a good concept, and it''s carried off well, with sufficient lighting to see both faces. It didn''t grab me, though, perhaps because the focus on both faces is soft, and the lower background really cluttered it up for my eyes (having both faces against the blue sky may have worked better for me, but it might also have been too stark).</td>', 'I felt like I should have liked this image better; it''s a good concept, and it''s carried off well, with sufficient lighting to see both faces. It didn''t grab me, though, perhaps because the focus on both faces is soft, and the lower background really cluttered it up for my eyes (having both faces against the blue sky may have worked better for me, but it might also have been too stark).', '2007-01-27 06:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290173, 456188, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image didn''t do much for me on the whole; interesting idea, but I would have wanted to see a bit more of the car (a shot between one and two seconds later might have worked better for me). It''s not particularly sharp, and the exposure on the car body is off (very bright) to my eyes.</td>', 'This image didn''t do much for me on the whole; interesting idea, but I would have wanted to see a bit more of the car (a shot between one and two seconds later might have worked better for me). It''s not particularly sharp, and the exposure on the car body is off (very bright) to my eyes.', '2007-01-27 06:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290174, 457553, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here and the use of a very narrow field of focus, but the subject itself is not sharp, and the light doesn''t really seem to be entering (the subject itself doesn''t seem to be in the light), so it didn''t work that well for me.</td>', 'I like the idea here and the use of a very narrow field of focus, but the subject itself is not sharp, and the light doesn''t really seem to be entering (the subject itself doesn''t seem to be in the light), so it didn''t work that well for me.', '2007-01-27 06:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290175, 457259, 43073, '<td valign="top">This shot didn''t do much for me; I get it, could be funny, but the image itself (with the head upside down) and the white spot in the upper left corner didn''t work for me.</td>', 'This shot didn''t do much for me; I get it, could be funny, but the image itself (with the head upside down) and the white spot in the upper left corner didn''t work for me.', '2007-01-27 06:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290177, 455473, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action, but the shot as a whole doesn''t really work for me. The background is distracting, and there isn''t a feeling of motion in the shot to my eyes (it looks like he''s hanging there to me, not jumping).</td>', 'Nice stop action, but the shot as a whole doesn''t really work for me. The background is distracting, and there isn''t a feeling of motion in the shot to my eyes (it looks like he''s hanging there to me, not jumping).', '2007-01-27 06:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290178, 457392, 43073, '<td valign="top">A suitable idea, but the image itself isn''t sharp enough for me, and I found the reflections in the windows distracting; having the shot set so that the windows were straight would have helped it for my eyes, as well.</td>', 'A suitable idea, but the image itself isn''t sharp enough for me, and I found the reflections in the windows distracting; having the shot set so that the windows were straight would have helped it for my eyes, as well.', '2007-01-27 06:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290180, 456978, 43073, '<td valign="top">While I like the idea here, I didn''t like the loss of quality from the brightness at the top (especially to the rocks to the right) and the loss from too dark shadows at the lower left.</td>', 'While I like the idea here, I didn''t like the loss of quality from the brightness at the top (especially to the rocks to the right) and the loss from too dark shadows at the lower left.', '2007-01-27 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290181, 456371, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the focus is either too narrow or is off altogether; with more light and a higher f-stop to bring in some sharpness, this might have worked, but without it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the focus is either too narrow or is off altogether; with more light and a higher f-stop to bring in some sharpness, this might have worked, but without it doesn''t work for me.', '2007-01-27 06:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290184, 457418, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image didn''t do much for me, primarily because the subject matter didn''t interest me, and the narrow depth of field left me wanting more sharpness on the overall image.</td>', 'This image didn''t do much for me, primarily because the subject matter didn''t interest me, and the narrow depth of field left me wanting more sharpness on the overall image.', '2007-01-27 06:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290187, 455692, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is a nice concept, and it''s carried off reasonably well, but I''m not a huge fan of completely backlit subjects, and I would have liked it better without the person standing in the middle and blocking the light from the sun. Still, bumping you up from the first score I gave it.</td>', 'This is a nice concept, and it''s carried off reasonably well, but I''m not a huge fan of completely backlit subjects, and I would have liked it better without the person standing in the middle and blocking the light from the sun. Still, bumping you up from the first score I gave it.', '2007-01-27 06:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290213, 456813, 43073, '<td valign="top">The subject matter here, and the generally drab lighting, didn''t do much for me. The set of stairs, down to a black door with the door handle showing (but not in focus), didn''t make it mysterious enough to hold up to the title.</td>', 'The subject matter here, and the generally drab lighting, didn''t do much for me. The set of stairs, down to a black door with the door handle showing (but not in focus), didn''t make it mysterious enough to hold up to the title.', '2007-01-27 07:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290215, 456803, 43073, '<td valign="top">The idea here is good, but the buildings in the back are too overexposed to be useful to the composition, and the clouds are too blue to make much difference either. Watching the white balance and perhaps going a bit darker might have helped here (though then the whole may have been too dark).</td>', 'The idea here is good, but the buildings in the back are too overexposed to be useful to the composition, and the clouds are too blue to make much difference either. Watching the white balance and perhaps going a bit darker might have helped here (though then the whole may have been too dark).', '2007-01-27 07:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290217, 457730, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image just didn''t work for me; if the eye is the portal, I didn''t see enough of the eye itself, though the selective desaturation is interesting, the image has too much under the eye and of the nose to really work for me, and the brightness under the eye was distracting for me.</td>', 'This image just didn''t work for me; if the eye is the portal, I didn''t see enough of the eye itself, though the selective desaturation is interesting, the image has too much under the eye and of the nose to really work for me, and the brightness under the eye was distracting for me.', '2007-01-27 07:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290261, 457280, 59073, '<td valign="top">Since your photo is named "Farmhouse gate", the gate should be the main subject ant it must be easily visible. But there are a lot of objects in the image and the attention from the entrance/gate is distracted. Nice touch with the black and white</td>', 'Since your photo is named "Farmhouse gate", the gate should be the main subject ant it must be easily visible. But there are a lot of objects in the image and the attention from the entrance/gate is distracted. Nice touch with the black and white', '2007-01-27 07:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290273, 457268, 56361, '<td valign="top">You can see the camera reflection in the eyes, thats not so pretty.</td>', 'You can see the camera reflection in the eyes, thats not so pretty.', '2007-01-27 07:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290364, 457651, 16402, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition for unusual entry! 7</td>', 'Great color and composition for unusual entry! 7', '2007-01-27 09:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290367, 456478, 16402, '<td valign="top">Great exposure with lots of different tones throughout various metals and wood.</td>', 'Great exposure with lots of different tones throughout various metals and wood.', '2007-01-27 09:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290371, 457720, 16402, '<td valign="top">Compositionally I think this would have been beter with girls already through the gate and into the grass clearning. Here''s why: Since you can''t see the girl''s faces making them smaller really wouldn''t detract -- the girls aren''t the subject of the photo anyway. Also it would have put the girls completely on a "third" point that leads eye into photo. Anyway, just MHO.</td>', 'Compositionally I think this would have been beter with girls already through the gate and into the grass clearning. Here''s why: Since you can''t see the girl''s faces making them smaller really wouldn''t detract -- the girls aren''t the subject of the photo anyway. Also it would have put the girls completely on a "third" point that leads eye into photo. Anyway, just MHO.', '2007-01-27 09:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290374, 457444, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice architectural type shot - very classic looking to me. Colors might be a bit flat but nice shot.</td>', 'Nice architectural type shot - very classic looking to me. Colors might be a bit flat but nice shot.', '2007-01-27 09:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290376, 457671, 16402, '<td valign="top">Fabulous concept, DOF and composition. 8</td>', 'Fabulous concept, DOF and composition. 8', '2007-01-27 09:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
