(3290426, 456893, 16402, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I don''t really see the "entrance" in this, but it does take my breath away. Absolutely spectacular!! 8</td>', 'Honestly, I don''t really see the "entrance" in this, but it does take my breath away. Absolutely spectacular!! 8', '2007-01-27 09:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290428, 457578, 16402, '<td valign="top">Man, the crane in the background really throughs this off for me.</td>', 'Man, the crane in the background really throughs this off for me.', '2007-01-27 09:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290438, 456938, 16402, '<td valign="top">Hearth?</td>', 'Hearth?', '2007-01-27 10:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290443, 455852, 43073, '<td valign="top">This clearly fits the challenge, but it doesn''t do much for me. The reflections in the glass (the actual entrance) are extremely distracting for me, as is the focus (which seems off when it comes to the doors. I generally do not like the lighting, which is a bit drab toward inside the pillars. Taking this shot at a different time of the day might have helped, though I''m not sure how to overcome the reflections in the glass.</td>', 'This clearly fits the challenge, but it doesn''t do much for me. The reflections in the glass (the actual entrance) are extremely distracting for me, as is the focus (which seems off when it comes to the doors. I generally do not like the lighting, which is a bit drab toward inside the pillars. Taking this shot at a different time of the day might have helped, though I''m not sure how to overcome the reflections in the glass.', '2007-01-27 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290447, 456418, 43073, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot in concept, and it has a generally good appearance, but the contrast seems off to me, significantly so in relation to the sky, and thus to anything (eg, the palms) that touch it. I also wish the top of the building had been level (difficult to do unless you shoot it straight on).</td>', 'I liked this shot in concept, and it has a generally good appearance, but the contrast seems off to me, significantly so in relation to the sky, and thus to anything (eg, the palms) that touch it. I also wish the top of the building had been level (difficult to do unless you shoot it straight on).', '2007-01-27 10:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290451, 456083, 43073, '<td valign="top">For me, this image isn''t visually interesting, and has some distractions (such as the water on the floor) that detract from it a bit.</td>', 'For me, this image isn''t visually interesting, and has some distractions (such as the water on the floor) that detract from it a bit.', '2007-01-27 10:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290458, 457035, 43073, '<td valign="top">I''ll buy these windows as an entrance, but the image seemed very busy to me, with some difficult focusing issues (the stones between the windows don''t seem to be in focus, and that throws me off as crossing the center is necessary to consider both windows). All the textures, without much that seemingly ties them together (other than that they''re part of the same building) increased the busy feel for me (and made it a bit much for me).</td>', 'I''ll buy these windows as an entrance, but the image seemed very busy to me, with some difficult focusing issues (the stones between the windows don''t seem to be in focus, and that throws me off as crossing the center is necessary to consider both windows). All the textures, without much that seemingly ties them together (other than that they''re part of the same building) increased the busy feel for me (and made it a bit much for me).', '2007-01-27 10:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290460, 457609, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image simply too bright for me; the back of the model''s head cuts out because of the brightness, as does much of the gate (as you move up). The model''s stance and facial expression don''t convey "gate keeper" to me, either.</td>', 'This image simply too bright for me; the back of the model''s head cuts out because of the brightness, as does much of the gate (as you move up). The model''s stance and facial expression don''t convey "gate keeper" to me, either.', '2007-01-27 10:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290462, 457433, 43073, '<td valign="top">This image didn''t really do much for me; there are brightness/contrast issues, and it''s not clear what''s being said with it.</td>', 'This image didn''t really do much for me; there are brightness/contrast issues, and it''s not clear what''s being said with it.', '2007-01-27 10:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290497, 455390, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image, but the fire doesn''t really look like fire; up to the buildings it''s a really good shot, in my opinion, but the flames just don''t hold up for me.</td>', 'This is an interesting image, but the fire doesn''t really look like fire; up to the buildings it''s a really good shot, in my opinion, but the flames just don''t hold up for me.', '2007-01-27 10:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290507, 456390, 43073, '<td valign="top">There was not much about this image that worked for me. The lead runner is out of focus, but the runners behind are also out not clearly in focus. As an image, it''s a shot of runners, but it doesn''t take me into the action or do more for me than show me they were there.</td>', 'There was not much about this image that worked for me. The lead runner is out of focus, but the runners behind are also out not clearly in focus. As an image, it''s a shot of runners, but it doesn''t take me into the action or do more for me than show me they were there.', '2007-01-27 10:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290514, 457720, 43073, '<td valign="top">There are some things I really like about this image, such as the way the light falls on the models and the bare part of the tree branch above them, but it is far too bright in the sky, and in such bright light I would have liked a wider depth of field so that the background was punchier in relation to the foreground.</td>', 'There are some things I really like about this image, such as the way the light falls on the models and the bare part of the tree branch above them, but it is far too bright in the sky, and in such bright light I would have liked a wider depth of field so that the background was punchier in relation to the foreground.', '2007-01-27 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290530, 457733, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it doesn''t work for me in the end, though I like it better looking this time than I did when I first saw it (and am bumping it up accordingly). Part of the problem for me is that the actual heart is not very sharp (and neither are the fingers); this could be a resizing issue, but I''m not sure. If it had been sharp, with maybe a warmer light, I think I would have   liked it more.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it doesn''t work for me in the end, though I like it better looking this time than I did when I first saw it (and am bumping it up accordingly). Part of the problem for me is that the actual heart is not very sharp (and neither are the fingers); this could be a resizing issue, but I''m not sure. If it had been sharp, with maybe a warmer light, I think I would have   liked it more.', '2007-01-27 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290721, 457503, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! The sepia works very nicely with this, as well as the shallow DOF. The cobwebs add a perfect touch. I''m going to bet you''ll get ribbon with this one. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-01 13:12:54.</i></td>', 'Beautiful shot! The sepia works very nicely with this, as well as the shallow DOF. The cobwebs add a perfect touch. I''m going to bet you''ll get ribbon with this one. :)', '2007-01-27 11:45:59.000000', '2007-02-01 13:12:54.000000', 1),
