(3293348, 457771, 59073, '<td valign="top">I like it. I think that the branches from the uppper left corner give the image a mistery touch and the black and white was a great choise.</td>', 'I like it. I think that the branches from the uppper left corner give the image a mistery touch and the black and white was a great choise.', '2007-01-28 09:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293354, 457571, 59073, '<td valign="top">Is the prince a girl? ...<br/>Anyway the photo could do better if he/she (the prince) would be in the frame entirely.</td>', 'Is the prince a girl? ...Anyway the photo could do better if he/she (the prince) would be in the frame entirely.', '2007-01-28 09:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293356, 457575, 59073, '<td valign="top">It makes me think to an exit rather than an entrance</td>', 'It makes me think to an exit rather than an entrance', '2007-01-28 09:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293358, 457713, 59073, '<td valign="top">It looks interesting but the tones are dull. Maybe some more contrast would be necessary...</td>', 'It looks interesting but the tones are dull. Maybe some more contrast would be necessary...', '2007-01-28 09:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293470, 457683, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love the upturned wing tips and the ''V'' shaped ''landing strip'' created by the reflection. Perfect timing!</td>', 'I love the upturned wing tips and the ''V'' shaped ''landing strip'' created by the reflection. Perfect timing!', '2007-01-28 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293475, 456760, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the blur in the moving water but feel that some of the twigs should have been removed or maybe just a change of angle, as they are a bit distracting, especially the red one in the bottom right hand corner.</td>', 'I like the blur in the moving water but feel that some of the twigs should have been removed or maybe just a change of angle, as they are a bit distracting, especially the red one in the bottom right hand corner.', '2007-01-28 10:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293489, 457533, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the way the floorboards lead towards the door in the direction the figure is walking and the tonal range is good. One suggestion, I would lighten the shadow that runs down behind the figures'' right arm and down the right leg to try and add a little detail as the solid black shadow is a bit harsh.</td>', 'I like the way the floorboards lead towards the door in the direction the figure is walking and the tonal range is good. One suggestion, I would lighten the shadow that runs down behind the figures'' right arm and down the right leg to try and add a little detail as the solid black shadow is a bit harsh.', '2007-01-28 10:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293494, 457444, 72714, '<td valign="top">The texture in the floor tiles and the walls is good but I feel the highlight on the left is a little bright.</td>', 'The texture in the floor tiles and the walls is good but I feel the highlight on the left is a little bright.', '2007-01-28 10:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293501, 455151, 72714, '<td valign="top">Brilliant mood! I love the halo effect on the left shoulder.</td>', 'Brilliant mood! I love the halo effect on the left shoulder.', '2007-01-28 10:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293508, 456255, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love the mystery of this picture. An arch, another arch, a third arch and then stairs going to who know''s where? A cool, monochrome image that changes to warm colour as you ''walk'' through it. Well done!</td>', 'I love the mystery of this picture. An arch, another arch, a third arch and then stairs going to who know''s where? A cool, monochrome image that changes to warm colour as you ''walk'' through it. Well done!', '2007-01-28 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293514, 455015, 72714, '<td valign="top">I think the photo lacks a focal point. Maybe a colourful beach ball or a child running towards the sea. Just a suggestion.</td>', 'I think the photo lacks a focal point. Maybe a colourful beach ball or a child running towards the sea. Just a suggestion.', '2007-01-28 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293522, 456847, 72714, '<td valign="top">What about cropping this image tighter to the top of the sunburst and to include the pillars on either side. I think it would be more dramatic.</td>', 'What about cropping this image tighter to the top of the sunburst and to include the pillars on either side. I think it would be more dramatic.', '2007-01-28 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293527, 457539, 72714, '<td valign="top">The distorted perspective is a bit distracting but I like the texture of the walls and peeling paint.</td>', 'The distorted perspective is a bit distracting but I like the texture of the walls and peeling paint.', '2007-01-28 10:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293530, 457753, 72714, '<td valign="top">Pity the tree in the middle is so tall and nobody makes ladders compact enough to fit into a camera bag!</td>', 'Pity the tree in the middle is so tall and nobody makes ladders compact enough to fit into a camera bag!', '2007-01-28 10:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293542, 456418, 72714, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry!</td>', 'Good symmetry!', '2007-01-28 11:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293555, 457404, 72714, '<td valign="top">My gosh, I wouldn''t want to be going down there! Good lighting which enhances the mood.</td>', 'My gosh, I wouldn''t want to be going down there! Good lighting which enhances the mood.', '2007-01-28 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293563, 457183, 72714, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love this photo! The tonal range is good, I like the way the figure is sitting with his bare feet showing and the knife, bottle and cigarettes lying in the corner really add to the ''story''.</td>', 'Excellent! I love this photo! The tonal range is good, I like the way the figure is sitting with his bare feet showing and the knife, bottle and cigarettes lying in the corner really add to the ''story''.', '2007-01-28 11:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293567, 457140, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but feel it could have been ''decluttered'' by removing the hosepipe in the foreground.</td>', 'I like this photo but feel it could have been ''decluttered'' by removing the hosepipe in the foreground.', '2007-01-28 11:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293572, 457199, 72714, '<td valign="top">A picture says a thousand words! In this case definately! I love the lighting on the childs face.</td>', 'A picture says a thousand words! In this case definately! I love the lighting on the childs face.', '2007-01-28 11:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293581, 457021, 72714, '<td valign="top">A slightly wider view would have included a little more of the bottom step, creating a ''frame'' around the entrance. Still a lovely picture.</td>', 'A slightly wider view would have included a little more of the bottom step, creating a ''frame'' around the entrance. Still a lovely picture.', '2007-01-28 11:09:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3293597, 455503, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the ''frame'' around the faces. I have to ask, where were YOU????</td>', 'I like the ''frame'' around the faces. I have to ask, where were YOU????', '2007-01-28 11:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293600, 455767, 72714, '<td valign="top">The series of arches are really effective but I think two or three people walking up the stairs into the arches would have added to this image.</td>', 'The series of arches are really effective but I think two or three people walking up the stairs into the arches would have added to this image.', '2007-01-28 11:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293603, 457720, 72714, '<td valign="top">Just wondering if a polariser would have reduced some of the glare on the trees and along the top of the picture.</td>', 'Just wondering if a polariser would have reduced some of the glare on the trees and along the top of the picture.', '2007-01-28 11:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293605, 456076, 72714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the little toes sticking out of the bottom of her dress.</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the little toes sticking out of the bottom of her dress.', '2007-01-28 11:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293608, 457719, 72714, '<td valign="top">What an amazing sky! You forgot to order the ship for the foreground though! Lol. Bet he came past when the sky was really bland!</td>', 'What an amazing sky! You forgot to order the ship for the foreground though! Lol. Bet he came past when the sky was really bland!', '2007-01-28 11:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293609, 457035, 72714, '<td valign="top">The colours and textures are beautiful but I feel you should have concentrated on the lower window only. At the moment, the picture is cut into two by the ledge above the lower window.</td>', 'The colours and textures are beautiful but I feel you should have concentrated on the lower window only. At the moment, the picture is cut into two by the ledge above the lower window.', '2007-01-28 11:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293652, 456938, 72957, '<td valign="top">Very good picture</td>', 'Very good picture', '2007-01-28 12:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293698, 455674, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a scene!  What a great idea to hide an unsightly entrance!  Lovely shot!</td>', 'Wow, what a scene!  What a great idea to hide an unsightly entrance!  Lovely shot!', '2007-01-28 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293703, 456027, 52992, '<td valign="top">Sky looks overly blue, almost purple, and too uniform.</td>', 'Sky looks overly blue, almost purple, and too uniform.', '2007-01-28 12:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293704, 455079, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Sounds like what I ask myself whenever I enter my own front door? *grin*  Lovely shot.</td>', 'Love the title.  Sounds like what I ask myself whenever I enter my own front door? *grin*  Lovely shot.', '2007-01-28 12:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293705, 456371, 52992, '<td valign="top">Fly is too 2-dimensional.  Red on nose is not flattering.</td>', 'Fly is too 2-dimensional.  Red on nose is not flattering.', '2007-01-28 12:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293708, 457730, 52992, '<td valign="top">Portal maybe ?<br/> <br/>I like the desat - makes the eye seem to be staring right at me - and he doesn''t look happy.</td>', 'Portal maybe ? I like the desat - makes the eye seem to be staring right at me - and he doesn''t look happy.', '2007-01-28 12:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293709, 455508, 68947, '<td valign="top">Looks like some place I''d wonder about entering anyways! *grin*  I think the contrast could have been upped a bit more for this shot.  Peeps in here seem to love the real contrasts.  Just my observation through the winning entries and my own shots.</td>', 'Looks like some place I''d wonder about entering anyways! *grin*  I think the contrast could have been upped a bit more for this shot.  Peeps in here seem to love the real contrasts.  Just my observation through the winning entries and my own shots.', '2007-01-28 12:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293713, 457528, 52992, '<td valign="top">So sweet - I love the expression.</td>', 'So sweet - I love the expression.', '2007-01-28 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293714, 455320, 52992, '<td valign="top">WOW.</td>', 'WOW.', '2007-01-28 12:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293727, 455718, 68947, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but how''d you get this shot without selection?  Seems like the pupil has been somehow enhanced by comparison to the rest of the shot.  Double exposure perhaps?  Interesting concept.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but how''d you get this shot without selection?  Seems like the pupil has been somehow enhanced by comparison to the rest of the shot.  Double exposure perhaps?  Interesting concept.', '2007-01-28 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293728, 456853, 68947, '<td valign="top">Was the pentagram drawn in or a light used and panned on a double exposure?  Interesting!</td>', 'Was the pentagram drawn in or a light used and panned on a double exposure?  Interesting!', '2007-01-28 12:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293730, 457392, 68947, '<td valign="top">What a lovely view!  Makes me want to go out into that world through that window.</td>', 'What a lovely view!  Makes me want to go out into that world through that window.', '2007-01-28 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293733, 456989, 68947, '<td valign="top">great angle and shot!  Love it!</td>', 'great angle and shot!  Love it!', '2007-01-28 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293735, 457444, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beatiful entrance scene!  A little blown out on the left hand side but, I can see where your difficulty would come in how to fix that with basic editing rules.  Perhaps, having cropped the left just a bit more but, it''s so beautiful that I see your dilema.  Darn really sunny days! *smile*</td>', 'Beatiful entrance scene!  A little blown out on the left hand side but, I can see where your difficulty would come in how to fix that with basic editing rules.  Perhaps, having cropped the left just a bit more but, it''s so beautiful that I see your dilema.  Darn really sunny days! *smile*', '2007-01-28 12:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293738, 456817, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!  Wow, how beautiful!  You know, I''ve heard it said in here that those photos that are smaller in size don''t do as well.  People like to see the larger sized shots and mark lower because they are comparing them to the larger ones.  I''m scoring this higher as I really like the shot!  But, I''m wondering if perhaps, having enlarged it just a bit more might bring your score up more????  Hope it is doing well!  Best of wishes.</td>', 'Lovely shot!  Wow, how beautiful!  You know, I''ve heard it said in here that those photos that are smaller in size don''t do as well.  People like to see the larger sized shots and mark lower because they are comparing them to the larger ones.  I''m scoring this higher as I really like the shot!  But, I''m wondering if perhaps, having enlarged it just a bit more might bring your score up more????  Hope it is doing well!  Best of wishes.', '2007-01-28 13:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293739, 457293, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''d be wondering of those floor boards are solid! *smile*.  Lovely shot.  Love the perspective in it!</td>', 'I''d be wondering of those floor boards are solid! *smile*.  Lovely shot.  Love the perspective in it!', '2007-01-28 13:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293743, 456226, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity and shot!  If only the meters weren''t on the wall it would have made for a really "old" look.  Love this shot!  I''m scoring it a 7</td>', 'Love the clarity and shot!  If only the meters weren''t on the wall it would have made for a really "old" look.  Love this shot!  I''m scoring it a 7', '2007-01-28 13:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293746, 457418, 68947, '<td valign="top">ok, now you''ve got me hungry!  THAT IS "pleasure"! *smile*</td>', 'ok, now you''ve got me hungry!  THAT IS "pleasure"! *smile*', '2007-01-28 13:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293749, 456255, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely "old world look" to this.  Love the shot!</td>', 'Lovely "old world look" to this.  Love the shot!', '2007-01-28 13:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293756, 455980, 68947, '<td valign="top">My Fave thus far!  Wonderful shot!!!</td>', 'My Fave thus far!  Wonderful shot!!!', '2007-01-28 13:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293759, 457533, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very artsty shot.  I''d be worried who was beyond the door if I was dressed like that! *smile*</td>', 'Very artsty shot.  I''d be worried who was beyond the door if I was dressed like that! *smile*', '2007-01-28 13:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293760, 457552, 68947, '<td valign="top">Oh, have I seen that look before! *smile*  Look at the intensity in the eyes!  A little bit out of focus and too much of a "snapshot" look to it by comparison.  Perhaps, a bit more cropping off of the top and a little bit more sharpening would have buffed this up a bit more?????</td>', 'Oh, have I seen that look before! *smile*  Look at the intensity in the eyes!  A little bit out of focus and too much of a "snapshot" look to it by comparison.  Perhaps, a bit more cropping off of the top and a little bit more sharpening would have buffed this up a bit more?????', '2007-01-28 13:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293762, 456132, 68947, '<td valign="top">Awwwww........to be able to swim right now!  That''s an inviting reminder that I can''t wait for SUMMER as I sit here shivering!!!! *smile*  Lovely idea and clear shot!</td>', 'Awwwww........to be able to swim right now!  That''s an inviting reminder that I can''t wait for SUMMER as I sit here shivering!!!! *smile*  Lovely idea and clear shot!', '2007-01-28 13:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293771, 455449, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity and color.  I''m just not too sure about the subject of "entrance".  Seems like he''s "entering" by walking to the mic, but I''m wondering if perhaps, the title could have given a bit more of a hint????  It also has a bit of a "snapshot" look to it, which I think may hold the votes back a bit by comparison to some of the other shots in here.  Man, I''m long winded!  Best of luck!</td>', 'Lovely clarity and color.  I''m just not too sure about the subject of "entrance".  Seems like he''s "entering" by walking to the mic, but I''m wondering if perhaps, the title could have given a bit more of a hint????  It also has a bit of a "snapshot" look to it, which I think may hold the votes back a bit by comparison to some of the other shots in here.  Man, I''m long winded!  Best of luck!', '2007-01-28 13:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293776, 455900, 68947, '<td valign="top">*Laughing*.........Uhhhhhhh........NOPE...........I''m glad you didn''t enter the "exit" shot in the "exit" challenge! *grin*</td>', '*Laughing*.........Uhhhhhhh........NOPE...........I''m glad you didn''t enter the "exit" shot in the "exit" challenge! *grin*', '2007-01-28 13:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293778, 457184, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beatiful shot and colors, but I''m not sure that I would have seen this as an "entrance"......more of a "rising".</td>', 'Beatiful shot and colors, but I''m not sure that I would have seen this as an "entrance"......more of a "rising".', '2007-01-28 13:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
