(3294002, 457456, 72714, '<td valign="top">This photo should maybe have been taken from the left of the couple so that they faced inwards and I would crop out the hands on the right. I like the lighting and mood though.</td>', 'This photo should maybe have been taken from the left of the couple so that they faced inwards and I would crop out the hands on the right. I like the lighting and mood though.', '2007-01-28 14:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
