(3304876, 457302, 62318, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I like the pattern on that black thing, along with the sun reflection. That is the only problem, too abstract for me, I don''t know what that black thing is... But I get it, otherworldy... It is a good play on light and dark. Maybe just a bit too pure of a black on the right, or trim it down a bit... Very sci-fi-ish and a great concept.</td>', 'Great idea. I like the pattern on that black thing, along with the sun reflection. That is the only problem, too abstract for me, I don''t know what that black thing is... But I get it, otherworldy... It is a good play on light and dark. Maybe just a bit too pure of a black on the right, or trim it down a bit... Very sci-fi-ish and a great concept.', '2007-01-30 22:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3304886, 454583, 62318, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose. Cute outfit. Nice angle. Some minor compression artifacts, but nothing major. Back and white works well and the lines are pretty good. Not sure about the table in the top left though. A few other "minor" distractions, curtain hanger... I actually think the flash hurt you here, or you needed another directional light to remove the hard shadows. Still a fun candid.</td>', 'Interesting pose. Cute outfit. Nice angle. Some minor compression artifacts, but nothing major. Back and white works well and the lines are pretty good. Not sure about the table in the top left though. A few other "minor" distractions, curtain hanger... I actually think the flash hurt you here, or you needed another directional light to remove the hard shadows. Still a fun candid.', '2007-01-30 22:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
