(3305382, 455989, 7467, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the kind comments. I really like taking shots along Lake Michigan - especially the dramatic ones. The night before this shot, there was a storm with high winds and blowing snow and waves splashing against the structure. The next day (when I took the shot), the result was these great ice formations with the sun making the ice really stand out against the dark sky. The dark clouds rolled in shortly after I took the shot... sometimes you get a break with the timing... Thanks Again!</td>', 'Thanks all for the kind comments. I really like taking shots along Lake Michigan - especially the dramatic ones. The night before this shot, there was a storm with high winds and blowing snow and waves splashing against the structure. The next day (when I took the shot), the result was these great ice formations with the sun making the ice really stand out against the dark sky. The dark clouds rolled in shortly after I took the shot... sometimes you get a break with the timing... Thanks Again!', '2007-01-31 00:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3305386, 457752, 18367, '<td valign="top">Had an inkling this might be yours.  Loved it and gave it a 9.  Congratulations on your placement... you truly deserved it.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'Had an inkling this might be yours.  Loved it and gave it a 9.  Congratulations on your placement... you truly deserved it. Ray', '2007-01-31 00:28:58.000000', NULL, 0),
