(3305831, 456881, 50641, '<td valign="top">Sheesh.  There''s nothing wrong with your photograph. I think there must be some hex on the sad, crumbly foundations of destroyed homes.  There''s one near us that I try shooting in all sorts of light and no matter what I do, it never looks as interesting in 2D.  That said, I bet that if this had been an advanced challenge, you would have been able to apply some funky processing to increase the curb appeal :)<br/> <br/>Well, on the bright side, it wasn''t your house!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Sheesh.  There''s nothing wrong with your photograph. I think there must be some hex on the sad, crumbly foundations of destroyed homes.  There''s one near us that I try shooting in all sorts of light and no matter what I do, it never looks as interesting in 2D.  That said, I bet that if this had been an advanced challenge, you would have been able to apply some funky processing to increase the curb appeal :) Well, on the bright side, it wasn''t your house! ', '2007-01-31 01:53:17.000000', NULL, 0),
