(3305958, 457774, 68504, '<td valign="top">Should have saved this for the "Bad" contest.  Thanks for the great gamut of comments on this last minute underexposed, unpolarized, unarranged and totally oversaturated image.  It was born a dud, but I tried to milk it - fascinating what information there is in these bad shots - and then, ignominy, posthumous beat me with supernumeral mathematics out of total extinction. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-31 02:47:01.</i></td>', 'Should have saved this for the "Bad" contest.  Thanks for the great gamut of comments on this last minute underexposed, unpolarized, unarranged and totally oversaturated image.  It was born a dud, but I tried to milk it - fascinating what information there is in these bad shots - and then, ignominy, posthumous beat me with supernumeral mathematics out of total extinction. ', '2007-01-31 02:44:23.000000', '2007-01-31 02:47:01.000000', 0),
