(3306335, 457268, 66548, '<td valign="top">the idea of the reflcation of the camera was to show that the camera is intruding the eyes in search of the soul. However, since most of the people has found it ditracting, probably it is so!!</td>', 'the idea of the reflcation of the camera was to show that the camera is intruding the eyes in search of the soul. However, since most of the people has found it ditracting, probably it is so!!', '2007-01-31 05:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
