(3306959, 457713, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hi Deb - nice idea!  One suggestion for you to try if you want to keep this pic for your own use...  I''d crop off some of the bottom, to cut out some of the grass and maybe even the path.  And then play with contrast - you need to bring out some brightness in the pic to play against the darker color of the trees.  Try it and I think you''ll be surprised at how different the pic looks.  Keep ''em coming!</td>', 'Hi Deb - nice idea!  One suggestion for you to try if you want to keep this pic for your own use...  I''d crop off some of the bottom, to cut out some of the grass and maybe even the path.  And then play with contrast - you need to bring out some brightness in the pic to play against the darker color of the trees.  Try it and I think you''ll be surprised at how different the pic looks.  Keep ''em coming!', '2007-01-31 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
