(3311304, 457704, 20168, '<td valign="top">To top the Brown Ribbon 2006 Master is sheer genius! Way to plummet into the cellar with this marvel. We''re laughing at your pathetic PP description! Continue with the LOL genius! Thanks!</td>', 'To top the Brown Ribbon 2006 Master is sheer genius! Way to plummet into the cellar with this marvel. We''re laughing at your pathetic PP description! Continue with the LOL genius! Thanks!', '2007-02-01 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
