(3316419, 455392, 62318, '<td valign="top">I simply love this picture. Wonderful exposure. Head crop works here. Beautiful expression on the child. Lots of little details make it a nice image, hair eye lashes, the rosy cheecks with the red blanket(?). Great lighting. A well composed shot that captures the innocence of children. The lower score was probably just to theme. While I get the relation, I think it relies to much on the title.</td>', 'I simply love this picture. Wonderful exposure. Head crop works here. Beautiful expression on the child. Lots of little details make it a nice image, hair eye lashes, the rosy cheecks with the red blanket(?). Great lighting. A well composed shot that captures the innocence of children. The lower score was probably just to theme. While I get the relation, I think it relies to much on the title.', '2007-02-01 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3316608, 456278, 62318, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. What makes it interesting is the chain and lock. I actually did not notice it the first time, and took a bit to see it here this 2nd time. I think that is really the key to the shot. I think an 8x10 crop would have given it a bit more focus, taking the top off slightly. Other than that it is a well composed shot. I like the slight cruves in the pillars and the nice repeating patterns in the door. A simple composition that actually has more going on to it after a 2nd take.</td>', 'An interesting shot. What makes it interesting is the chain and lock. I actually did not notice it the first time, and took a bit to see it here this 2nd time. I think that is really the key to the shot. I think an 8x10 crop would have given it a bit more focus, taking the top off slightly. Other than that it is a well composed shot. I like the slight cruves in the pillars and the nice repeating patterns in the door. A simple composition that actually has more going on to it after a 2nd take.', '2007-02-01 23:44:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317303, 456278, 26669, '<td valign="top">interesting angle on this. i would like to see a straight on version croped tight to the pillars. good effort</td>', 'interesting angle on this. i would like to see a straight on version croped tight to the pillars. good effort', '2007-02-02 02:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
