(3360480, 457533, 74107, '<td valign="top">I love the photograph a lot, but something about the movement of the person and the way his hand it out bothers me, It''d appealed to me more of a still thing so it''d kind of radiate a more calm.. which is the feeling the grays and use of light does.<br/>Personal opinion, I dont like humans though... in almost any photo, sodont take it personally.  =]</td>', 'I love the photograph a lot, but something about the movement of the person and the way his hand it out bothers me, It''d appealed to me more of a still thing so it''d kind of radiate a more calm.. which is the feeling the grays and use of light does.Personal opinion, I dont like humans though... in almost any photo, sodont take it personally.  =]', '2007-02-13 09:13:01.000000', NULL, 0),
