(5438366, 455618, 105952, '<td valign="top">Words like enchanting, beautiful, inviting, lovely, and "a bit off center" have been used below to describe this photo.  All of these words can be used also to describe the man buried right underneath that stone bench in the middle of the frame, my grandfather.  Great job on capturing this photo and matching the photo to the man who made this beautiful place his home.<br/> <br/>Bruce_the_Robert - you''ve got it!  Like I stated above, this photo is perfect....you may have missed that its a grave site, now maybe you will understand how truly perfect this photo is.  Like all great art, the picture should capture the subject...and the subject in this case, is the man buried in the middle of the garden.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-15 09:18:16.</i></td>', 'Words like enchanting, beautiful, inviting, lovely, and "a bit off center" have been used below to describe this photo.  All of these words can be used also to describe the man buried right underneath that stone bench in the middle of the frame, my grandfather.  Great job on capturing this photo and matching the photo to the man who made this beautiful place his home. Bruce_the_Robert - you''ve got it!  Like I stated above, this photo is perfect....you may have missed that its a grave site, now maybe you will understand how truly perfect this photo is.  Like all great art, the picture should capture the subject...and the subject in this case, is the man buried in the middle of the garden.', '2009-04-15 09:50:28.000000', '2009-04-15 10:18:16.000000', 0),
